# Kernel cmdline additions (single line in /boot/firmware/cmdline.txt). Quiet,
# splash-free boot → power-on to a calm first frame with no console flashes
# (PI_DOCK_SPEC §2.6). Append these tokens to the existing line:
#
#   quiet loglevel=0 vt.global_cursor_default=0 logo.nologo plymouth.ignore-serial-consoles consoleblank=0
#
# - quiet loglevel=0           : suppress kernel log spam
# - vt.global_cursor_default=0 : no blinking console cursor
# - logo.nologo                : hide the Pi logo
# - consoleblank=0             : never blank the console (the app owns dimming)
#
# For a read-only root, also add (managed by the image's overlay tooling):
#   boot=overlay
